Z||000011||Nashco||10-25-2001||09:24 PM||||Wow, that looks excellent!  I have always like Corbeau seats, but wasn't sure if they would be narrow enough or not; thanks for putting those fears to bed!  I think that when I get the seats, I won't get the Corbeau adapters, though.  I am about 6', and I just like to be low down, so I will engineer something up that is still low slung and adjustable.<P>Thanks for the pics and info, those look SWEET!  I especially like the four point harness capability...I LOVE a full belt, makes it much easier to feel the car.<P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||1
