Z||000014||Nashco||10-25-2001||10:09 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by reddog:<BR><B>Hey Nashco I was just curious how much you could have sold me the Carrera seats for?I have a feeling the salesman at the store I bought mine fed me a large helping of   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_bs.gif"> <P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Actually, I think you meant to ask TRiAD that question...<P>FYI, he charged you retail price, it looks like.  If you shop around, you can almost always find prices below the MSRP on anything, except for maybe Harley-Davidsons, Plutonium, and Uranium <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Yes, TRiAD...is it a possibility to POST the cost you can get us?  I may be ready for a quote, or I may be only halway ready for a quote <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  If not, that's cool..I understand how it works..and I'll get in contact with ya when I have a pocket full of cash (yeah..right).<P>Bryce<BR>88 GT<BR>||||reg||1
