Z||000016||TRiAD||10-25-2001||11:11 PM||||There are many models of seats from Corbeau alone, and there are some very nice seats form Cobra and especially Sparco. <P>Pricing will depend on exactly what seat you're wanting (what material it's covered in), which mounting options, and timing. MANY suppliers have fluctuating prices throughout the year.<P>It just simply wouldn't do any of us any good to post current "virtual" prices on a single specific application. People who DO post "permanent" prices have padded them for variables in costs. I use no such padding.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Sorry, and thanks!||||reg||1
